---
import { LinkButton } from "@astrojs/starlight/components";
---

<section class="new-to-esphome card-bgc">
  <div class="container">
    <input type="checkbox" id="new-to-esphome-toggle" class="accordion__toggle" />
    <div class="content-container">
      <label for="new-to-esphome-toggle" class="accordion__header">
        <h2>New to ESPHome? Read this!</h2>
        <span class="accordion__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </label>

      <div class="accordion__content">
        <div class="accordion__content-inner">
          <p>
            Every ESPHome device is built around a small, inexpensive chip called a microcontroller – commonly an ESP32
            (hence the name ESPHome!), but it also works with others like the Raspberry Pi RP2040. The chip is the
            programmable part that controls your sensors, switches, and displays. ESPHome creates the programming that
            runs on the chip, telling it what to do. Once installed, the chip can then “talk” directly to Home Assistant
            or any other smart home system that supports it.
          </p>

          <LinkButton href="/install/">Get started</LinkButton>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
  @use "../../styles/mixins" as *;

  .new-to-esphome {
    :global(.container) {
      @include bp(large-desktop) {
        padding: 3rem 0;
      }
    }

    .accordion__toggle {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
      clip: rect(0 0 0 0);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .accordion__header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;

      h2 {
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }
    }

    .accordion__toggle:focus-visible ~ .content-container .accordion__header {
      outline: 2px solid var(--sl-color-accent);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .accordion__icon {
      position: relative;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 1rem;
      height: 1rem;

      &::before,
      &::after {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 50%;
        left: 50%;
        background: currentColor;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      }

      &::before {
        width: 100%;
        height: 2px;
      }

      &::after {
        width: 2px;
        height: 100%;
      }
    }

    .accordion__toggle:checked ~ .content-container .accordion__icon::after {
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scaleY(0);
    }

    .accordion__content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: 0fr;
      transition: grid-template-rows 0.3s ease;

      a {
        margin: 1.5rem 0 0;
      }
    }

    .accordion__toggle:checked ~ .content-container .accordion__content {
      grid-template-rows: 1fr;
    }

    .accordion__content-inner {
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    p {
      @include fluid(16, 24, $property: padding-top);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
